WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.033
-Well, the Republican meltdown
in the House

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:05.167
just keeps on getting
more humiliating for the party

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.701
and, specifically,
for GOP Leader Kevin McCarthy,

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:09.834
who has now, as of this taping,

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:12.734
lost eight consecutive votes
to become speaker,

00:00:12.734 --> 00:00:15.767
leaving one of two chambers
of Congress in total paralysis,

00:00:15.767 --> 00:00:18.467
as Republicans and Fox News
hosts bicker with each other,

00:00:18.467 --> 00:00:20.400
stab each other in the backs,
and call each other names.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.300
And I got to say,
it's pretty fun to watch.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:25.901
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:29.901
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.667
Let's just step back
for a minute

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:33.000
and remember all the predictions

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.167
of what Republicans thought
would happen this week.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:37.200
On the back of a massive
midterm red wave,

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:40.400
the GOP would sweep into power
and anoint Kevin McCarthy

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.334
as the forceful new speaker
of the House,

00:00:42.334 --> 00:00:44.601
who would use the GOP's
new position of strength

00:00:44.601 --> 00:00:45.601
to go on the offensive

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:46.734
against Joe Biden
and the Democrats.

00:00:46.734 --> 00:00:50.033
McCarthy even repeatedly
made a very bizarre joke

00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:52.300
about wanting
to hit Nancy Pelosi

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.501
with the speaker's gavel

00:00:53.501 --> 00:00:55.734
when she, inevitably,
handed it over to him,

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:57.868
although, it didn't always
make sense.

00:00:57.868 --> 00:01:00.267
-Reporting about comments made

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:04.200
by Minority Leader McCarthy
about Nancy Pelosi

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.934
during a Tennessee GOP dinner
last night,

00:01:06.934 --> 00:01:09.767
some pretty shocking audio
that we're getting right now.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:10.567
Listen to this.

00:01:15.868 --> 00:01:18.434
[ Whistling and applause ]

00:01:24.434 --> 00:01:27.167
I want you to watch
Nancy Pelosi hand me that gavel.

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:29.601
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:01:29.601 --> 00:01:31.200
And I promise you this --

00:01:33.567 --> 00:01:35.100
I won't bang her with it,

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.534
but I'll bang the end
to the socialism

00:01:37.534 --> 00:01:39.434
and yes to America.

00:01:39.434 --> 00:01:40.634
[ Laughter ]
-Are you

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:42.901
sure you didn't bang yourself
with it?

00:01:42.901 --> 00:01:45.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:47.868
"I'll bang the end
to the socialism

00:01:47.868 --> 00:01:49.200
and yes to America."

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.400
I can't believe that soaring
message didn't resonate.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:53.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.701 --> 00:01:55.367
He has the same broken syntax

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:58.100
as a Norwegian tourist looking
for the M&amp;M store.

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:00.901
[ Norwegian accent ]
Can you say where is the store
of the chocolate circles

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:04.100
who mouth melt without doing
the same to one's hands?

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:08.601
So, McCarthy and the GOP
were full of bravado

00:02:08.601 --> 00:02:10.000
about how they would seize
the gavel

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.133
in a show of Republican power

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:12.567
and confront Joe Biden
and the Democrats.

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:15.067
Instead, we got
this split screen --

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:17.634
feuding Republicans in utter
chaos on the House floor,

00:02:17.634 --> 00:02:20.801
while Joe Biden
was eating peach cobbler

00:02:20.801 --> 00:02:23.000
[ Laughter ]
at a barbecue joint
in Cincinnati.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.467
[ Applause ]
The only way

00:02:24.467 --> 00:02:27.167
that could've been any more fun
for Biden right now is

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:28.601
if he was eating
his peach cobbler

00:02:28.601 --> 00:02:31.067
while sitting in the back row
of the House of Representatives.

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:32.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:34.601
And you know
Biden's the kind of guy

00:02:34.601 --> 00:02:36.400
who gets every last bite
of cobbler.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.367
He'd be back there loudly
scraping his fork

00:02:39.367 --> 00:02:41.133
around the sides
of his little dish.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.834
[ As Biden ]
Hey, sorry! I know you gang
are trying to find a speaker.

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:45.734
It's just this is
some damn good cobbler.

00:02:45.734 --> 00:02:48.400
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.100
They call me
the Cobbler Gobbler.

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:52.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:53.434
It's yet another reminder

00:02:53.434 --> 00:02:55.501
you can't underestimate
Joe Biden.

00:02:55.501 --> 00:02:58.367
A lot of people thought he was
some sort of bumbling Mr. Magoo

00:02:58.367 --> 00:03:01.234
who falls off bicycles
and wanders around stage

00:03:01.234 --> 00:03:04.300
like an extra
in a Broadway show,

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:06.033
[ Laughter ]
accidentally entered too early

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:08.367
and is hoping no one notices.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.367 --> 00:03:10.801
[ As Biden ]
Hey, is it time
for "Mr. Mistoffelees" yet?

00:03:10.801 --> 00:03:12.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.667 --> 00:03:14.033
No?

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:15.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.834 --> 00:03:17.667
Mind if I just hang out here
until it is?

00:03:17.667 --> 00:03:19.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.467 --> 00:03:21.367
But in reality,
Biden has, somehow,

00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.734
spent two years scoring
one political win after another

00:03:23.734 --> 00:03:25.234
and bucking historical trends,

00:03:25.234 --> 00:03:27.067
while Republicans just
eat each other alive.

00:03:27.067 --> 00:03:29.567
Joe Biden might secretly be
a political mastermind

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.601
who's just pretending
to be old and confused.

00:03:31.601 --> 00:03:34.200
He's basically
President Doubtfire because...

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.734 --> 00:03:38.067
...while Biden's chowin' down
on cobbler,

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:39.801
Republicans are meltin' down
before our eyes

00:03:39.801 --> 00:03:42.467
and proving to the nation they
just can't be trusted to govern.

00:03:42.467 --> 00:03:44.501
-This is a portrait
of paralysis.

00:03:44.501 --> 00:03:46.868
This is what the Republicans
have told the country

00:03:46.868 --> 00:03:47.968
in the last two months.

00:03:47.968 --> 00:03:50.367
Historic underperformance
in the midterm,

00:03:50.367 --> 00:03:53.334
followed by historic
institutional chaos.

00:03:53.334 --> 00:03:55.267
-I mean, this is --

00:03:55.267 --> 00:03:57.167
I don't want to say
an unmitigated disaster

00:03:57.167 --> 00:03:59.467
for Kevin McCarthy,
but it's close.

00:03:59.467 --> 00:04:00.634
-It's pretty bad.

00:04:00.634 --> 00:04:02.267
-Let's get back to our top story
right now,

00:04:02.267 --> 00:04:06.267
the truly historic humiliation
of Congressman Kevin McCarthy.

00:04:06.267 --> 00:04:09.701
-Wow, it is brutal when someone
as neutral as Wolf Blitzer

00:04:09.701 --> 00:04:10.801
burns you that hard.

00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:11.901
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:11.901 --> 00:04:13.033
It's like if you got wasted

00:04:13.033 --> 00:04:14.567
and [bleep] your pants
at a college party

00:04:14.567 --> 00:04:16.167
and Walter Cronkite was there

00:04:16.167 --> 00:04:18.133
[ Laughter ]
to report on it.

00:04:18.133 --> 00:04:20.667
[ As Cronkite ]
A harrowing scene today
at Sigma Chi

00:04:20.667 --> 00:04:23.300
as Kevin lost control
of his bowels

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:25.234
at 3 am Pacific time and...

00:04:25.234 --> 00:04:27.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.667 --> 00:04:29.801
...defecated into his trousers.

00:04:29.801 --> 00:04:31.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:31.968 --> 00:04:34.100
But it truly is humiliating.
McCarthy has now lost

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.300
eight straight votes
for speaker of the House.

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:38.467
This is the first time
in 100 years

00:04:38.467 --> 00:04:40.634
it's taken even more
than one ballot

00:04:40.634 --> 00:04:42.334
to elect a speaker,
let alone eight.

00:04:42.334 --> 00:04:45.667
And the crazy thing is,
because nothing else can happen

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:47.300
until a speaker is elected,

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:51.334
McCarthy just has to sit there,
losing votes over and over.

00:04:51.334 --> 00:04:53.968
[ Laughter ]
The only other thing
the House can do is adjourn,

00:04:53.968 --> 00:04:55.434
but then when they come back
from adjournment,

00:04:55.434 --> 00:04:57.534
they just have to vote again.
That's it.

00:04:57.534 --> 00:04:58.734
McCarthy's stuck in some sort

00:04:58.734 --> 00:05:00.734
of nightmarish
existential purgatory,

00:05:00.734 --> 00:05:03.367
like the waiting room scene
in "Beetlejuice," you know, but,

00:05:03.367 --> 00:05:07.300
[ Laughter ]
next to someone scarier
than anyone in that movie.

00:05:07.300 --> 00:05:09.968
[ Laughter and applause ]
He's lost eight times!

00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:11.834
And, every time they hold one
of these votes,

00:05:11.834 --> 00:05:13.667
it goes down pretty much
the exact same way.

00:05:13.667 --> 00:05:16.000
They call the roll,
McCarthy loses,

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.234
they tally up the votes,

00:05:17.234 --> 00:05:19.667
and the clerk announces
the results like this.

00:05:19.667 --> 00:05:22.367
-A speaker has not been elected.

00:05:22.367 --> 00:05:24.501
A speaker
has not been elected.

00:05:24.501 --> 00:05:26.834
[ Laughter ]
A speaker has not been elected.

00:05:26.834 --> 00:05:29.234
A speaker
has not been elected.

00:05:29.234 --> 00:05:31.334
A speaker has not been elected.

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:33.534
A speaker
has not been elected.

00:05:33.534 --> 00:05:35.601
A speaker has not been elected.

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:38.200
A speaker
has not been elected.

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.467
-It's like getting all the way
up to the altar

00:05:40.467 --> 00:05:42.501
and then your fiancé(e) says,
"I don't,"

00:05:42.501 --> 00:05:44.133
and, instead of going home,
the priest says,

00:05:44.133 --> 00:05:46.567
"What do you say, everybody,
should we try it again?!"

00:05:46.567 --> 00:05:47.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:47.667 --> 00:05:51.167
And everyone's like,
"Yeah! Ask again!"

00:05:51.167 --> 00:05:52.534
[ Laughter ]

00:05:52.534 --> 00:05:54.467
And it's especially funny
to watch Republicans try

00:05:54.467 --> 00:05:56.701
to put a positive spin
on this embarrassing debacle.

00:05:56.701 --> 00:05:58.200
For example,
they all keep insisting

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.033
that what we're actually seeing
is a healthy sign of democracy

00:06:01.033 --> 00:06:03.701
and diversity of thought
within the Republican Party.

00:06:03.701 --> 00:06:06.234
-Diversity of thought
is a good thing.

00:06:06.234 --> 00:06:07.968
It's one of the things
that sets us apart

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:09.567
from our friends
on the other side of the aisle.

00:06:09.567 --> 00:06:12.467
Yes, diversity of thought
is a good thing.

00:06:12.467 --> 00:06:14.701
-It looks messy.

00:06:14.701 --> 00:06:16.601
[ Laughter ]
But democracy is messy!

00:06:16.601 --> 00:06:18.434
[ Cheering and applause ]
Democracy is messy!

00:06:18.434 --> 00:06:21.067
By!
By design.

00:06:21.067 --> 00:06:23.968
-Unlike Democrats,
members of the Republican Party,

00:06:23.968 --> 00:06:25.801
they're not sheep who are --

00:06:25.801 --> 00:06:27.801
you know,
will do what they are told.

00:06:27.801 --> 00:06:29.267
-If you prefer real debates

00:06:29.267 --> 00:06:30.501
about issues
that actually matter,

00:06:30.501 --> 00:06:32.334
it's pretty refreshing
to see it.

00:06:32.334 --> 00:06:33.434
Yes, it's a little chaotic,

00:06:33.434 --> 00:06:35.300
but this is what
it's supposed to be.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.200
-Yeah, watching Republicans
paralyze the government

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.067
and sit through a never-ending
existential hell

00:06:39.067 --> 00:06:41.033
of bickering and name calling
is actually a good thing.

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:41.968
[ Laughter ]
I'm sure Americans love it.

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:43.434
When voters see Lauren Boebert

00:06:43.434 --> 00:06:44.334
and Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:06:44.334 --> 00:06:45.167
screaming at each other

00:06:45.167 --> 00:06:46.434
like two suburban hockey moms

00:06:46.434 --> 00:06:47.901
[ Laughter ]
on opposite sides of a game,

00:06:47.901 --> 00:06:50.000
I'm sure they can't help
but think to themselves...

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:51.267
-Yes to America.

00:06:51.267 --> 00:06:53.367
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.367 --> 00:06:55.167
-Alright, we'll say it.
I am in no rush

00:06:55.167 --> 00:06:56.534
for this particular

00:06:56.534 --> 00:06:57.868
House of Representatives
to get to work.

00:06:57.868 --> 00:06:59.534
I mean, if Republicans
ever figure their [bleep] out,

00:06:59.534 --> 00:07:01.601
it's just going to be two years
of Hunter Biden's laptop

00:07:01.601 --> 00:07:03.367
and threats
to detonate the economy

00:07:03.367 --> 00:07:05.167
and Anthony Fauci
in a dunk tank.

00:07:05.167 --> 00:07:07.300
[ Laughter ]
So, by all means,
take your time.

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.167
Also, just a side note --
during one of those speeches,

00:07:09.167 --> 00:07:12.367
Republicans accused Democrats
of drinking and eating popcorn

00:07:12.367 --> 00:07:15.167
as they watched
the GOP [bleep]show unfold,

00:07:15.167 --> 00:07:17.467
[ Laughter ]
prompting oohs
from the rest of the House.

00:07:17.467 --> 00:07:19.133
-They want us divided.

00:07:19.133 --> 00:07:20.934
They want us
to fight each other.

00:07:20.934 --> 00:07:23.534
That much has been made clear
by the popcorn and blankets

00:07:23.534 --> 00:07:26.567
and alcohol that is coming
over there.

00:07:26.567 --> 00:07:29.334
[ Voices overlapping ]

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:30.868
-Oooooh!

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:31.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:31.868 --> 00:07:33.100
This whole thing is turning

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.667
into an episode of "Maury."

00:07:34.667 --> 00:07:35.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:37.200
Tonight's episode is called...

00:07:39.968 --> 00:07:42.767
[ Laughter ]
[ Theme plays ]

00:07:42.767 --> 00:07:45.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:47.501 --> 00:07:50.400
Now, you might be thinking
it has to be against the rules

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.334
to drink alcohol
in the House of Representatives

00:07:52.334 --> 00:07:54.501
and, to be clear, I have no idea
if that's what's happening,

00:07:54.501 --> 00:07:56.567
but regardless,
it doesn't matter because,

00:07:56.567 --> 00:07:59.534
until they elect a speaker,
there are no rules.

00:07:59.534 --> 00:08:01.000
[ Laughter ]
It's a free-for-all.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.634
They might as well be doing
these votes on a party boat

00:08:03.634 --> 00:08:05.033
in Italy with Tanya.

00:08:05.033 --> 00:08:07.067
[ Laughter ]
In fact, you may not know this,

00:08:07.067 --> 00:08:09.701
but that's why C-SPAN has been
so kickass this week.

00:08:09.701 --> 00:08:11.767
Normally, they're restricted
to one camera pointed

00:08:11.767 --> 00:08:14.734
at a bunch of empty chairs,
but while this drags on,

00:08:14.734 --> 00:08:17.334
they can basically film
whatever the hell they want.

00:08:17.334 --> 00:08:20.601
They can whip around the chamber
like a squirrel wearing a GoPro.

00:08:20.601 --> 00:08:21.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:21.601 --> 00:08:23.767
And it's been amazing
this week.

00:08:23.767 --> 00:08:26.367
We got to see Republican
election denier Paul Gosar

00:08:26.367 --> 00:08:29.133
chewing off AOC's ear
while she made a face

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:31.601
like she'd rather
he literally chew it off.

00:08:31.601 --> 00:08:34.701
[ Laughter ]
What Republicans are dealing
with right now is

00:08:34.701 --> 00:08:36.167
the core problem
of the modern GOP,

00:08:36.167 --> 00:08:37.667
a party that is
fundamentally broken.

00:08:37.667 --> 00:08:39.534
This is the dynamic
Trump exposed,

00:08:39.534 --> 00:08:40.634
but it also predated him.

00:08:40.634 --> 00:08:42.968
Republicans were happy
to appease,

00:08:42.968 --> 00:08:45.467
and even use the crazies
in their party to gain power,

00:08:45.467 --> 00:08:48.701
but now, the crazies are
in power with them

00:08:48.701 --> 00:08:50.501
and it's coming back to bite
Republicans in the ass.

00:08:50.501 --> 00:08:51.734
It's like in high school
when you got invited

00:08:51.734 --> 00:08:52.901
to a party one town over,

00:08:52.901 --> 00:08:54.033
but the only person you know

00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:55.534
who had a car was Weird Gary.

00:08:55.534 --> 00:08:56.934
You'd say, "How bad can it be?

00:08:56.934 --> 00:08:58.467
He'll drive us to the party
and then we can ditch him."

00:08:58.467 --> 00:09:00.400
But then every time you start
talking to a cute girl,

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.067
Weird Gary would appear
right next to you,

00:09:02.067 --> 00:09:03.334
[ Laughter ]
breathing all heavy.
He'd be like,

00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:05.033
"Hey, I'm Seth's friend.

00:09:05.033 --> 00:09:07.133
[ Laughter ]

00:09:07.133 --> 00:09:08.968
Yes to America!"

00:09:08.968 --> 00:09:10.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:10.868 --> 00:09:13.234
Even Donald Trump can't seem
to rein in any of these people.

00:09:13.234 --> 00:09:14.934
He's apparently
called them repeatedly

00:09:14.934 --> 00:09:16.701
to lobby on behalf of McCarthy,

00:09:16.701 --> 00:09:18.801
but after a recent
Trump phone call,

00:09:18.801 --> 00:09:20.267
right-wing
Congressman Matt Gaetz,

00:09:20.267 --> 00:09:22.601
one of the leaders in the
anti-McCarthy revolt, said...

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.534
[ Laughter ]
MAGA Republicans
are even starting

00:09:25.534 --> 00:09:27.334
to turn around
and give orders to Trump,

00:09:27.334 --> 00:09:29.133
like Colorado Congresswoman
Lauren Boebert,

00:09:29.133 --> 00:09:30.334
who said, on the House floor,

00:09:30.334 --> 00:09:32.534
that, instead of lobbying
on McCarthy's behalf,

00:09:32.534 --> 00:09:35.601
Trump should call McCarthy
and tell McCarthy to drop out,

00:09:35.601 --> 00:09:38.601
once again, prompting
some oohs from the chamber.

00:09:38.601 --> 00:09:42.200
-Let's stop
with the campaign smears

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:45.601
and tactics to get people
to turn against us,

00:09:45.601 --> 00:09:48.100
even having
my favorite president

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.801
call us and tell us we need
to knock this off.

